// Persian (source language) strings of Eleza Desktop.
//
//   "lng_key" = "value with {tag}";
//   "lng_plural#one" / "lng_plural#other" = "{count} …";   -> tr::lng_plural(tr::now, lt_count, n)
//
// Use: tr::lng_key(tr::now)  /  tr::lng_key(tr::now, lt_tag, value).
// lang_en.strings must contain exactly the same keys and tags (codegen_lang checks it).
//
// Strings ported from the web client keep a "// pwa:" comment with the original key
// (the web client's keys are the Persian texts: tr('…') in pwa/src/ui/i18n.ts).


